  {
   "id": "garden-life-a-cozy-simulator-204554@1.2",
   "gameId": "garden-life-a-cozy-simulator-204554",
   "displayName": "Update 1.2",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-03-18T16:29:56.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello fellow green thumbs!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once again, we'd like to thank you for all your feedback. We're still working hard to try fixing the problems you may have, but it's great to see your stunning garden screenshots!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today a new patch is being released, fixing the bug when buying the winter fences and causing the game to crash. We are also adding the continuous cutting when you keep holding the button: no more spamming!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Winter fence crash fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "UI crash when opening fast fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cat has run off home from the outside of the garden",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Holding the use button with the cutting tool allows for continuous cutting",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Additional rucksack slots are now functioning as normal in creative mode",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can expect more fixes coming in the coming weeks!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Warm whishes,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Garden Life team 🌼",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Join-us",
